	// If floor((s + k) / 2) >= s, then all t from 0 to s are invalid, and the sum is C(s+2, 2)
	// Otherwise, the sum is sum_{t=0}^{floor((s+k)/2)} (t + 1) = (floor((s+k)/2) + 1) * (floor((s+k)/2) + 2) / 2

